<br />

<br />
Baking: 161
<br />
Tailoring: 113 &lt;--biggest pain in the rear tradeskill, I must say!
<br />
Smithing: 137
<br />
Fletching:  147
<br />
Brewing: 168
<br />
Jewelry: 120  &lt;--one word: ouch.  big hit to the pp, but not as bad as I expected  :/
<br />
