				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I have noticed the crag's dining habits on halflings....The halfling meat however does make a mean Hot and Spicy Toeling...My rogue friend and my dearly departed roguette made many a meal on this stat food.  <img src="images/smiles/icon_lol.gif" alt="icon_lol.gif" border="0" /> 
